rors"],"url":"/troubleshooting#a-tmux-copy-in-vs-code-web-never-reaches-the-laptop-clipboard---the-browser-build-drops-osc-52","content":"A tmux copy in VS Code Web never reaches the laptop clipboard -> the browser build drops OSC 52"},"1479":{"id":"/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":["troubleshooting","operate","errors"],"url":"/troubleshooting#vs-code-web-tab-in-chrome-creeps-to-gigabytes-or-freezes-now-and-then---every-tab-was-another-mirror-of-one-pane","content":"VS Code Web tab in Chrome creeps to gigabytes, or freezes now and then -> every tab was another mirror of one pane"},"1480":{"id":"/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":["troubleshooting","operate","errors"],"url":"/troubleshooting#github-token-expired-or-the-workspace-has-no-github-account---github-reauth","content":"GitHub token expired, or the workspace has no GitHub account -> GitHub reauth"},"1481":{"id":"/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":["troubleshooting","operate","errors"],"url":"/troubleshooting#gh_token_refresh-says-gh-would-not-store-the-minted-token","content":"gh_token_refresh says gh would not store the minted token"},"1482":{"id":"/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":["troubleshooting","operate","errors"],"url":"/troubleshooting#private-repo-clone-or-push-denied-while-a-credential-is-present---the-grant-not-the-format","content":"Private-repo clone or push denied while a credential is present -> the grant, not the format"},"1483":{"id":"/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":["troubleshooting","operate","errors"],"url":"/troubleshooting#gh-answers-bad-credentials---the-stale-env-pair-not-the-store","content":"`gh` answers `Bad credentials` -> the stale env pair, not the store"},"1484":{"id":"/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":["troubleshooting","operate","errors"],